</ul>
<h2>Living areas and bedrooms</h2>
<p>Hoovered carpets, skirting boards, window sills and wardrobe interiors. If you’re a student in shared housing, see our <a href="{{guide:student-house-move-out-cleaning-hull}}">Hull student move-out guide</a> for communal areas.</p>
<h2>How to store and send photos</h2>
<p>Back up to cloud storage with the tenancy address in the folder name. Email a link to yourself and the agent on check-out day. If a dispute arises, the deposit scheme will ask for originals — see <a href="{{guide:what-letting-agents-check-at-check-out}}">what letting agents check at check-out</a>.</p>
<h2>Professional help</h2>
<p>We provide <a href="{{local:end-of-tenancy-cleaning-hull}}">end of tenancy cleaning in Hull</a> with a checklist you can photograph on completion. <a href="{{page:contact}}">Get a fixed quote</a> before your move-out date.</p>
