<p>Wipe handles, kettle base, coffee machine drip tray and sink. Run dishwasher or wash shared mugs. Our <a href="{{guide:office-cleaning-checklist}}">office cleaning checklist</a> splits tasks by frequency.</p>
<h2>Weekly fridge clear-out</h2>
<p>Discard unlabelled food, wash shelves with food-safe cleaner, check seals. Post the date of the next clear-out on the door.</p>
<h2>Monthly jobs</h2>
<p>Degrease microwave inside and out, descale kettle, clean behind bins. Align with <a href="{{guide:cleaning-regulations-for-businesses}}">workplace cleaning responsibilities</a> — kitchens support welfare, not just aesthetics.</p>
